{
  "description": "When a light shines - a glowing face, a cabin lamp, a headlight alike. groups (a model's light groups in order) and values (their control groups' values; none: 0) -> on (the groups on: convention.ModelParts.litMask, value above 0, the first 64) and lit (per light, its group by name or null and invert = LINVERT: ModelParts.lit - no group always, else while the group is on, with LINVERT while it is off). With a model (obj, mtl, model as in model_parts): on, and whether each headlight, cabin lamp and glowing (FULLBRIGHT) part shines.",
  "frame": "none",
  "tolerance": 0,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "no-group-shines-always",
      "note": "a light of no group shines with every group off",
      "input": {"groups": ["IL"], "values": {}, "lights": [{"group": null, "invert": false}]},
      "expected": {"on": [], "lit": [true]}
    },
    {
      "id": "its-group-on",
      "note": "a light shines while its group is on",
      "input": {
        "groups": ["IL", "FHL"],
        "values": {"IL": 0, "FHL": 1},
        "lights": [{"group": "FHL", "invert": false}, {"group": "IL", "invert": false}]
      },
      "expected": {"on": ["FHL"], "lit": [true, false]}
    },
    {
      "id": "linvert-shines-with-its-group-off",
      "note": "LINVERT: lit while the group is off, a headlight as a glowing face",
      "input": {"groups": ["FHL"], "values": {"FHL": 0}, "lights": [{"group": "FHL", "invert": true}]},
      "expected": {"on": [], "lit": [true]}
    },
    {
      "id": "linvert-dark-with-its-group-on",
      "note": "LINVERT: dark while the group is on",
      "input": {
        "groups": ["FHL"],
        "values": {"FHL": 1},
        "lights": [{"group": "FHL", "invert": true}, {"group": "FHL", "invert": false}]
      },
      "expected": {"on": ["FHL"], "lit": [false, true]}
    },
    {
      "id": "a-value-above-zero-is-on",
      "note": "a group is on above 0, a dimmer at a quarter too",
      "input": {
        "groups": ["NL"],
        "values": {"NL": 0.25},
        "lights": [{"group": "NL", "invert": false}, {"group": "NL", "invert": true}]
      },
      "expected": {"on": ["NL"], "lit": [true, false]}
    },
    {
      "id": "zero-negative-and-nan-are-off",
      "note": "0, below 0 and NaN are off",
      "input": {
        "groups": ["A", "B", "C"],
        "values": {"A": 0, "B": -0.5, "C": "NaN"},
        "lights": [
          {"group": "A", "invert": false},
          {"group": "B", "invert": false},
          {"group": "C", "invert": false},
          {"group": "C", "invert": true}
        ]
      },
      "expected": {"on": [], "lit": [false, false, false, true]}
    },
    {
      "id": "a-missing-value-is-off",
      "note": "a group the wagon never set is off",
